# Invisible ink: drying, browning and burning are different changes
# Lemon juice and paper can be heated, but caramelisation and Maillard browning
# are missing. The modeled burn endpoint must not be mistaken for brown writing.
register lv2
add v1 paper 2g
add v1 lemon_juice 2mL
heat v1 2kJ
look v1
heat v1 20kJ
look v1
# Separate virtual burn control. Never ignite real paper for this activity.
new crucible
add v2 paper 2g
add v2 O2 0.5mol
ignite v2
look v2
